---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Terms of use" description="The terms for using Engrebodds predictions and tips." noindex>
  <div class="stack prose" style="max-width:72ch">
    <div>
      <h1>Terms of use</h1>
      <p class="draft"><strong>Draft, needs legal review.</strong> These terms must be checked by a lawyer before launch, including which law governs them and the position under Nigerian state gambling regulation.</p>
    </div>
    <section>
      <h2>Information only</h2>
      <p>Engrebodds publishes statistical predictions for information and entertainment. They are estimates, not advice and not guarantees. Any bet you place is your own decision and at your own risk.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>18 or older</h2>
      <p>The site is for people aged 18 or over. If gambling is not legal where you are, don't use our tips to bet.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>We are not a bookmaker</h2>
      <p>We don't take bets, don't place bets for anyone and never ask for bookmaker logins. Bookmaker names are used only to describe where a selection can be placed; we are not affiliated with them. Prices shown may differ from a bookmaker's current odds.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>The track record</h2>
      <p>Every published tip is graded after full time and kept; tips are never edited after they lock or deleted. [How later score corrections are handled to be confirmed before launch.]</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Using our content</h2>
      <p>You may share links to our pages. Copying predictions or the track record in bulk for commercial use needs our permission.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Liability</h2>
      <p>To the extent the law allows, we are not responsible for losses from bets placed using our content, or for errors in third-party data such as fixtures, results and odds. [Wording to be confirmed with legal advice.]</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms; the date of the latest version will be shown here. [Governing law to be confirmed.]</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
